- **Tool artifacts** (per substantive feature, under **`{{OUTPUT_DIR}}`** = `docs/agent-orchestra/`):
  - `{{OUTPUT_DIR}}/<feature-slug>/prd.md` · `design.md` — only for big features (optional)
  - `{{OUTPUT_DIR}}/<feature-slug>/<YYYY-MM-DD>/review.md` · `report.md` — per run
- **History index:** `{{OUTPUT_DIR}}/INDEX.md` — a timeline; every substantial run appends a row
  (date · feature · what/why · links). Start here to understand the project's history.
- **Small changes / quick fixes:** inline review only — write no doc files.

